# S10 — rbac-permissions-capabilities (issue #1189). Drift-override BUILD.
# Pure capabilities vs docs/implementations/rbac-matrix.md §7/§8/§10 (+ policy overlays).
# PolicyOn is meaningful for TA manage-topics and instructor/unit view-course-chats —
# do NOT force PolicyOn=no for unit/instructor (needed for view-course-chats coverage).
# docs/PICT_CENSUS.md § S10
Access:        admin, unit, instructor, ta, student, none
Capability:    view-material, delete-material, rename-material, view-topics, manage-topics, view-course-chats
IsPublished:   yes, no
PolicyOn:      yes, no
MaterialOwn:   yes, no

IF [Capability] in {"delete-material", "rename-material", "manage-topics", "view-course-chats"} THEN [IsPublished] = "yes";
IF [Access] in {"admin", "student", "none"} THEN [PolicyOn] = "no";
IF [Capability] in {"view-material", "view-topics", "delete-material", "rename-material"} THEN [PolicyOn] = "no";
IF [Capability] in {"view-material", "view-topics", "manage-topics", "view-course-chats"} THEN [MaterialOwn] = "yes";
